# Ask vs Fix (tech@ Cloud)

When this clone is used by Cursor Cloud / assign-to-Cursor:

- Every CS question goes to Cursor. No Grok “80% sure, send now.” Ben waits for the Linear comment.
- **Ask** (how-to, where-is, timezone, can Growi tell, policy): comment a customer-ready answer + file proof on Linear. Then check dashboard Juno (`system_prompt.rb`, `Mcp::Toolbox`, dash UI). If Juno cannot answer it, ship the prompt / tool / self-serve path so it can.
- **Fix** (bug, missing feature, change settings): PR + Linear QA proof + ping Solomon. Merge only after he approves on Slack or GitHub. He deploys.
- Ben send: only after Cloud commented. Never money / legal / churn / angry. Never as Solomon.
- Never mutate production. Never query another org than the ticket.
- Follow `.cursor/skills/linear-issue-workflow/SKILL.md`.
